@startuml
title AI标签扫描与智能搜索用例实现顺序图
participant "机主" as P0
participant "MainController" as P1
participant "ScanTask" as P2
participant "OpenAICompatibleService" as P3
participant "TagDao" as P4
participant "SearchService" as P5
participant "PostgreSQL" as P6
P0 -> P1: 点击补打AI标签/保存扫描目录
P1 -> P2: 启动后台ScanTask
P2 -> P6: 查询当前目录待识别图片
P2 -> P3: analyzeImage(file,id)
P3 -> P2: 返回JSON标签/描述
P2 -> P4: saveAnalysisResult + batchInsertTags
P4 -> P6: 写入 ai_analysis_results/image_tags
P0 -> P5: 输入关键词或自然语言
P5 -> P6: 查询v_image_search或执行安全SQL
P5 -> P1: 返回图片集合刷新缩略图
@enduml
